[
    {
        "content": "<p>This is probably a question for <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"315577\">@Mac Malone</span>, and I’m fully ready to read the “don’t do that” answer. I have a package defining several facets, each coming from a different Lean file in the same package. A minimized version as the following lakefile</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DSL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">System</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">package</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mwe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">default_target</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">lean_lib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mwe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">lean_exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">root</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Mwe.Foo</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">module_facet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fooer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FilePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">findLeanExe?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`«</span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"no foo executable configuration found in workspace\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">olean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getWorkspace</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">root</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">unless</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outDir</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pathExists</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FS</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">createDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outDir</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bindM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mapM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">modFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">buildFileUnlessUpToDate'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">proc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">cmd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">lean_exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">root</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Mwe.Bar</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">module_facet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">barer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FilePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">findLeanExe?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`«</span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">»</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"no foo executable configuration found in workspace\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">olean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getWorkspace</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">root</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bar\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">unless</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outDir</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pathExists</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FS</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">createDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outDir</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bindM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mapM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">modFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">buildFileUnlessUpToDate'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">proc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">cmd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>It works, in the sense I can run <code>lake build Mwe.Hello</code> followed by <code>lake build Mwe.Hello:fooer</code> or <code>lake build Mwe.Hello:fooer</code>. But I cannot run <code>lake build</code> because both <code>Mwe.Foo</code> and <code>Mwe.Bar</code> defining a <code>main</code> function and this causes a clash. The full project is <br>\n<a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/2E0aYQhk8Wki5fwrDuqaOlqe/mwe.zip\">mwe.zip</a></p>\n<p>The main question is really: am I doing something really stupid here? If not, if there anyway I can run <code>lake build</code> and build all my stuff without name clash? Or should I have only one lean file defining a main function per package? Or can I call it something else than main and still use it as a facet?</p>",
        "id": 627813302,
        "sender_full_name": "Patrick Massot",
        "timestamp": 1790694105
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I suspect you do not want to look for the exe via <code>findLeanExe?</code>, but instead just want to call</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module_facet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fooer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FilePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">olean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 627894939,
        "sender_full_name": "Thomas Murrills",
        "timestamp": 1790713188
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Then, instead of including your exe's in your root file, just rely on them getting built by being <code>@[default_target]</code>s :) (I.e., do not import your <code>main</code>s)</p>",
        "id": 627895088,
        "sender_full_name": "Thomas Murrills",
        "timestamp": 1790713230
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110031\">@Patrick Massot</span> It is hard to debug your example without the contents of <code>Mwe.lean</code>, <code>Mwe/Foo.lean</code>, and <code>Mwe/Bar.lean</code>. If I had to guess, you are importing both <code>Mwe.Foo</code> and <code>Mwe.Bar</code> in root <code>Mwe</code> and that causes a clash between the two definitions of <code>main</code>. If so, remove the imports.  The root of a executable should never be imported. If there is code in the module with <code>main</code> you would like to import, move that code into a different module within <code>Mwe</code> (e.g., <code>Mwe.FooUtil</code>).</p>\n<p>As Thomas noted, modern Lake provides new utilities to update your example <code>lakefile.lean</code>. </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Updated lakefile.lean</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DSL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">System</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">package</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mwe</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">default_target</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">lean_lib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mwe</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">lean_exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">root</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Mwe.Foo</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">module_facet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fooer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FilePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">olean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getRootPackage</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bindM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mapM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">modFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">art</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildArtifactUnlessUpToDate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">createParentDirs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">proc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">cmd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">art</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">path</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">lean_exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">root</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Mwe.Bar</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">module_facet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">barer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FilePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">olean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getRootPackage</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildDir</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bar\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exeJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bindM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">modJob</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mapM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">modFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">art</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buildArtifactUnlessUpToDate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">createParentDirs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">proc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">cmd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exeFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">outFile</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">art</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">path</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
